# The iLOL kernel — licensing

Kernel code contributed in this repository is licensed
**GPL-2.0-only**, matching the Linux kernel. The
[GNU GPL v2 text](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.txt) applies
to any kernel source, patch or configuration committed here.

Upstream sources (the Linux kernel, Arch's `linux` package) keep their own
copyright and license notices; this repository adds nothing on top of them.
Documentation in this repository is licensed
[CC0](https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
